# The live stage of the guide to writing a package: the same code as the
# package, as a config file (`config/Config/WordCount.lean`) that
# `config/init.lean` imports. Config's command of a name is found before a
# package's, so although the fixture set's editor also links the package,
# the reload's count, 2 files and 1 command, says config registered
# `word-count`, and the command that runs is config's. It touches no file.

reload
settle

key i KeyI -
commit one two  three
key <Escape> Escape -
run word-count
scene
